          "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 03 2025 23:18:32 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Adaptable</span></span></p>\n<p>If desired, MEDPOR material may be cut and shaped to fit patient and surgeon needs.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sterile</span></span></p>\n<p>Implants packaged sterile and ready to use. They can be stored in the hospital or office to have on hand as needed.</p>\n",
